KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp
--stdlib libc++
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^PARSING ERROR$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
libc++-20's <algorithm> internal headers (iterator_operations.h,
lower_bound.h) use if-with-initializer and other C++17/20
constructs that CBMC's C++ parser cannot handle, causing
PARSING ERROR when no explicit C++ standard is specified.
